{"qid": 356, "answered": null, "resp": "Because her son is an adult, you must protect his confidentiality unless he has authorized disclosure or a legal exception applies. You may listen to her concerns and offer general guidance without confirming that he is your client or revealing information about his treatment.\n\nFINAL: Explain that you cannot discuss or confirm anyone\u2019s treatment without their consent, but you can listen to her concerns and provide general support resources.", "final": "Explain that you cannot discuss or confirm anyone\u2019s treatment without their consent, but you can listen to her concerns and provide general support resources."}
